#: rc.cpp:3
msgid "Chart"
msgstr "kaart"

#: kchartBackgroundPixmapConfigPage.cc:35
msgid ""
"On this page, you can select colors or images to be displayed behind the "
"different areas. You can also select whether the images should be stretched "
"or scaled or centered or used as background tiles."
msgstr ""

#: kchartBackgroundPixmapConfigPage.cc:53
msgid "&Background color:"
msgstr "agtergrond kleur:"

#: kchartBackgroundPixmapConfigPage.cc:58
msgid "Here you set the color in which the background of the chart is painted."
msgstr "hier jy stel die kleur in wat die agtergrond van die kaart is gekleur."

#: kchartBackgroundPixmapConfigPage.cc:66
msgid ""
"You can select a background image from this list. Initially, the installed "
"KDE wallpapers will be offered. If you do not find what you are looking for "
"here, you can select any image file by clicking on the <i>Browse</i> button "
"below."
msgstr ""
"jy kan kies 'n agtergrond beeld van hierdie lys. aanvanklik, die "
"geïnstalleer kde wallpapers sal wees aan bied. as jy doen nie soek wat jy "
"word besig om te soek vir hier, jy kan kies enige beeld lêer deur te kliek "
"op die <i>blaai</i> knoppie onder."

#: kchartBackgroundPixmapConfigPage.cc:73
msgid "None"
msgstr "geen"

#: kchartBackgroundPixmapConfigPage.cc:82
msgid "&Browse..."
msgstr "blaai..."

#: kchartBackgroundPixmapConfigPage.cc:83
msgid ""
"Click this button to select a background image not yet present in the list "
"above. "
msgstr ""
"kliek hierdie knoppie aan kies 'n agtergrond beeld nie nog voordra in die "
"lys boonste. "

#: kchartBackgroundPixmapConfigPage.cc:89
msgid ""
"This area will always display the currently selected background image. Note "
"that the image will be scaled and thus might have a different ratio than it "
"originally had."
msgstr ""
"hierdie area sal altyd vertoon die huidiglik gekose agtergrond beeld. nota "
"wat die beeld sal wees skaleer en dus dalk het 'n ander verhouding as dit "
"oorspronkilik moes."

#: kchartBackgroundPixmapConfigPage.cc:100
msgid ""
"In this box, you can set various settings that control how the background "
"image is displayed."
msgstr ""
"in hierdie boks, jy kan stel verskeie instellings wat kontrole hoe die "
"agtergrond beeld is vertoon."

#: kchartBackgroundPixmapConfigPage.cc:107
#, c-format
msgid "&Intensity in %"
msgstr "hewigheid in %"

#: kchartBackgroundPixmapConfigPage.cc:110
#, c-format
msgid ""
"Here you can select how much the image should be brightened up so that it "
"does not disturb the selected area too much."
"<br>"
" Different images require different settings, but 25% is a good value to "
"start with."
msgstr ""
"hier jy kan kies hoe baie die beeld moet wees verhelder begin sodat wat dit "
"doen nie versteur die gekose area te baie."
"<br> ander beelde vereis ander instellings, maar 25% is 'n goeie waarde aan "
"begin met."

#: kchartBackgroundPixmapConfigPage.cc:119
msgid "Stretched"
msgstr ""

#: kchartBackgroundPixmapConfigPage.cc:121
msgid ""
"If you check this box, the selected image will be scaled to fit the total "
"size of the selected area. Image ratio will be adjusted to match the area "
"size and height if neccessary."
msgstr ""

#: kchartBackgroundPixmapConfigPage.cc:125
msgid "Scaled"
msgstr "skaleer"

#: kchartBackgroundPixmapConfigPage.cc:127
msgid ""
"If you check this box, the selected image will be scaled to match the height "
"or width of the selected area - whichever is reached first."
msgstr ""

#: kchartBackgroundPixmapConfigPage.cc:130
msgid "Centered"
msgstr "gesentreer"

#: kchartBackgroundPixmapConfigPage.cc:132
msgid ""
"If you check this box, the selected image will be centered over the selected "
"area. If the image is larger then the area, you will only see the middle "
"part of it."
msgstr ""
"as jy bevestig hierdie boks, die gekose beeld sal wees gesentreer bo die "
"gekose area. as die beeld is grootter dan word die area, jy sal slegs sien "
"die middelste deel van dit."

#: kchartBackgroundPixmapConfigPage.cc:136
msgid "Tiled"
msgstr "geteël"

#: kchartBackgroundPixmapConfigPage.cc:138
msgid ""
"If you check this box, the selected image will be used as background tile. "
"If the image is larger then the selected area, you will only see the upper "
"left part of it."
msgstr ""
"as jy bevestig hierdie boks, die gekose beeld sal wees gebruik word as "
"agtergrond teël. as die beeld is grootter dan word die gekose area, jy sal "
"slegs sien die boonste links deel van dit."

